1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,266
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,266 --> 00:00:03,880
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:04,933
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,133 --> 00:00:08,013
=Episode 24=

5
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:21,000
I can't believe what Bao'er did!

6
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:37,759
This...

7
00:00:38,799 --> 00:00:40,520
Xie Bao'er!

8
00:00:45,079 --> 00:00:45,399
Oh,

9
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:47,039
don't you have a blind date today?

10
00:00:47,159 --> 00:00:48,520
When are you going?

11
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:50,240
I have you, Mrs. Xie.

12
00:00:51,079 --> 00:00:52,200
Why would I need a blind date?

13
00:00:55,573 --> 00:00:57,866
(Bao'er Calling)

14
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:00,079
Hua!

15
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:01,960
Did you get your gift?

16
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:04,799
Listen,

17
00:01:05,319 --> 00:01:07,840
I picked this out just for you.

18
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,920
It's the bestselling

19
00:01:10,159 --> 00:01:13,319
strappy black lace lingerie.

20
00:01:14,879 --> 00:01:18,040
With those curves of yours,

21
00:01:18,319 --> 00:01:21,040
you'll drive Dad wild!

22
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,000
Show him

23
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:24,959
even heroes fall for your charms.

24
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:27,280
- A night of love is priceless!
- Xie Bao'er!

25
00:01:27,879 --> 00:01:28,400
You got this!

26
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:28,959
You...

27
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:40,200
Bao'er's just talking nonsense.

28
00:01:48,879 --> 00:01:49,519
I think

29
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,000
it's just your size.

30
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:55,680
Xie Zhouhan!

31
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,719
Xie Bao'er's being ridiculous,

32
00:01:57,799 --> 00:01:58,840
and you're joining in?

33
00:02:01,239 --> 00:02:02,120
(Oh no.)

34
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:04,959
(He must think I'm shameless.)

35
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,120
How about

36
00:02:09,599 --> 00:02:11,120
you show me

37
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:12,639
why even heroes fall for your charms?

38
00:02:16,026 --> 00:02:16,893
♪Closer to you♪

39
00:02:17,140 --> 00:02:19,026
♪Like stars falling into my dreams♪

40
00:02:19,380 --> 00:02:21,280
♪All my cautious little gestures♪

41
00:02:21,660 --> 00:02:23,900
♪You make me certain♪

42
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:24,640
♪I like you♪

43
00:02:24,940 --> 00:02:27,080
♪Every breath draws me toward you♪

44
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,813
♪If fate could speak♪

45
00:02:29,140 --> 00:02:31,920
♪It must mean I was meant to meet you♪

46
00:02:32,133 --> 00:02:33,880
♪Closer to you♪

47
00:02:35,860 --> 00:02:38,413
♪Closer to you♪

48
00:02:39,820 --> 00:02:46,280
♪You're the joy I just can't hide♪

49
00:02:49,330 --> 00:02:51,000
♪If rain falls from a sunny sky♪

50
00:02:51,220 --> 00:02:52,826
♪I'll tilt my umbrella toward you♪

51
00:02:53,260 --> 00:02:56,800
♪If your courage ever fails,
I'll walk beside you, step by step♪

52
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:59,520
♪Love isn't about possession♪

53
00:03:01,599 --> 00:03:03,199
(After spending all this time with him,)

54
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,400
(somehow, I've fallen for him.)

55
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,080
(Maybe)

56
00:03:08,599 --> 00:03:10,199
(it's time we talked about us.)

57
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:20,120
(Lin Hua clearly has feelings
for me, too.)

58
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:21,800
(When)

59
00:03:21,879 --> 00:03:23,240
(will she finally say we're together)

60
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,280
(and make it public?)

61
00:03:45,919 --> 00:03:46,599
Hua,

62
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:48,639
it's Grandma.

63
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:49,960
Dragon Boat Festival's coming up.

64
00:03:50,039 --> 00:03:51,439
I've made you zongzi.

65
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,360
Come pick them up soon.

66
00:03:54,759 --> 00:03:55,120
Okay.

67
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,960
Good thing we asked Ms. Xue to help.

68
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,599
Look how nicely she's wrapped them.

69
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,480
(Yes.)

70
00:04:17,519 --> 00:04:18,079
Ma'am.

71
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:20,720
Hua!

72
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:21,560
Come on in!

73
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,639
I brought you a few things.

74
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:27,279
I made red date and
bean paste zongzi for you.

75
00:04:27,439 --> 00:04:28,120
Ma'am,

76
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,800
you said your blood sugar's high,

77
00:04:29,879 --> 00:04:30,879
and you can't eat very sweet foods.

78
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,120
So why so many sweet ones?

79
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,240
I can't eat them,

80
00:04:33,399 --> 00:04:34,720
but you can.

81
00:04:35,959 --> 00:04:36,759
Sit.

82
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:39,800
Young girls like you

83
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:41,879
should eat more sweet things,

84
00:04:41,959 --> 00:04:43,360
for a sweeter life.

85
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,120
By the way,

86
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,759
Hua, you said

87
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,040
you're from Rongcheng,

88
00:04:49,199 --> 00:04:49,720
right?

89
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,360
You see,

90
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:54,639
I have a very good friend

91
00:04:54,759 --> 00:04:57,639
from Honghe Town in Rongcheng.

92
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:01,959
She was wonderful.

93
00:05:02,079 --> 00:05:03,360
She moved back home,

94
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,519
and for years,

95
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:07,439
she helped raise my grandson.

96
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:11,079
He was such a withdrawn boy.

97
00:05:11,399 --> 00:05:14,399
Thanks to her loving care,

98
00:05:14,959 --> 00:05:17,319
he didn't shut the whole world out.

99
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,000
Deep down,

100
00:05:20,079 --> 00:05:22,279
I'm so grateful to her,

101
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,160
you know?

102
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:25,519
Hua,

103
00:05:26,399 --> 00:05:27,399
I'll tell you,

104
00:05:27,639 --> 00:05:28,959
the first time I saw you,

105
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:30,120
I thought you looked

106
00:05:30,199 --> 00:05:31,959
so much like her.

107
00:05:34,399 --> 00:05:35,839
My mom used to say

108
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:39,839
every meeting is a reunion
after years apart.

109
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:41,920
So meeting you

110
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:44,360
must be its own kind of fate.

111
00:05:44,839 --> 00:05:46,439
Yes!

112
00:05:48,319 --> 00:05:48,759
Ma'am,

113
00:05:49,079 --> 00:05:50,519
what's your friend's name?

114
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:52,519
Maybe I met her in Honghe Town.

115
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:53,519
Ma'am.

116
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:54,879
Mr. Xie's here.

117
00:05:54,959 --> 00:05:56,639
He's taking you home for the festival.

118
00:05:58,079 --> 00:05:59,160
My ungrateful grandson

119
00:05:59,439 --> 00:06:00,879
finally remembered me.

120
00:06:24,733 --> 00:06:25,520
♪You say you♪

121
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:27,290
♪Don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

122
00:06:28,026 --> 00:06:30,800
♪You're just fine on your own♪

123
00:06:31,306 --> 00:06:33,890
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

124
00:06:34,226 --> 00:06:36,810
♪And the pain you face at night♪

125
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:40,410
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

126
00:06:41,306 --> 00:06:43,860
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

127
00:06:44,106 --> 00:06:46,780
♪Some love needs no promises♪

128
00:06:47,053 --> 00:06:50,220
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

129
00:06:50,466 --> 00:06:52,800
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

130
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:56,010
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

131
00:06:56,706 --> 00:06:59,240
♪I'm right behind you♪

132
00:06:59,626 --> 00:07:02,610
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

133
00:07:02,973 --> 00:07:05,210
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

134
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:09,200
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

135
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:15,410
♪I'm right behind you♪

136
00:07:16,053 --> 00:07:17,410
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

137
00:07:17,493 --> 00:07:19,210
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

138
00:07:19,413 --> 00:07:21,520
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

139
00:07:22,140 --> 00:07:23,226
♪I'm right behind you♪

140
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:25,680
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

141
00:07:25,946 --> 00:07:27,410
♪I won't claim you♪

142
00:07:27,533 --> 00:07:29,020
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

143
00:07:29,213 --> 00:07:31,680
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

144
00:07:33,060 --> 00:07:35,026
♪Waiting for you♪
